<title>JORDAN: Jordan average dinar o/n rates fall to 2.62 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan average dinar o/n rates fall to 2.62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar dropped to 2.62 percent on Thursday from 2.65 percent on Wednesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded in nine reported transactions worth 16.8 million dinars ($23.7 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
